                    draw: 'Draw the before (Machine) and after (Printer, Scanner, Fax) designs.',
                    apply: 'Split a Worker interface with work(), eat() and sleep() so that a RobotWorker isn\'t forced to implement eat().',
                    tradeoffs: 'How can you tell when an interface has become too small?',
